Bandit Level 0

Challenge: Log into the Bandit server.

Solution:

ssh bandit0@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220

Explanation:

ssh starts a secure shell session.
bandit0 is the username.
bandit.labs.overthewire.org is the host
-p 2220 specifies the port.

What I learned:
SSH lets you remotely connect to another Linux computer.
